# R6-2 (1): a callable field in a merge result body is read by the common body construction (a named Structure's
# `fn: name` field), but no merge carries one yet: refused where the item stands.
Model:
    size_t: x 1U
end: Model

fn: f () int
    return: 1
end: f

R: merge: Model
    fn: f
end: merge
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 0; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
